findings.what:
With native grovehunters (ardit, kemdo, nurrow) carrying Hourstrike, as real drafts give them:
- they are level 3.7–3.9 at 10:00 and 5.5–5.7 at 15:00, against 9.3–9.6 for the solo laners;
- the gap at 15:00 averages 3.7–4.0 levels (range 0.5–6.5);
- they end at level 7.7–8.2;
- they farm about 1.0 cs/min and die 7.6–8.8 times, the most of any role;
- 'farm' is only 49% of their time; 16% goes to recall and return, and 26% to objective, defend and roam.

The content also caps the role:
- an own-side clear pays 886 XP (4 small camps 586 every 150 s, 2 buffs 300 every 270 s), at most about 300 XP/min;
- a solo laner on full waves gets about 576 XP/min.

