- keep `requires` protection in sudden death;
- replace the protection drop with VALE's own 'Gorge Wind' escalation (stacking Wick buffs and structure resist decay), with a ×2 respawn multiplier;
- retune BRIDGE toward a natural 15–18 min;
- apply the same change to rift_quick;
- soak gate: at most 25% of games end in sudden death, and 0 cores fall with their chain standing.

